---
title: Potato and Onion Grills with Olives
description: Potato slices with extra flavour
source: https://www.justapinch.com/recipes/side/potatoes/potato-and-onions-grills-with-olives.html
author: Lynnda Cloutier
image: https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/O7nBNizie2RZEJdSWV97lWz_EaSCQzyf8hffAZCefcG7dCyntmx6TMFyypKvET1OkZogF0qnM9PayP1LjYCt3QvaeVq_h1U4VRbq0q4
servings: 6
course: Main
prep time: 20m
cook time: 30m
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Medium
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- vegetarian
- side-dish
